      <title>Rep. Pappas Says New Hampshire Race Is Not in the Bag</title>
      <link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-10-18/rep-pappas-says-new-hampshire-race-is-not-in-the-bag-video</link>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">fbd4f1d75e352afd155d5c4b</guid>
      <pubDate>Sun, 18 Oct 2026 12:50:41 +0000</pubDate>
      <description>Rep. Chris Pappas, the Democratic nominee for US Senate in New Hampshire, tells Bloomberg This Weekend that his race against former Republican Sen. John E. Sununu remains highly competitive despite Democratic optimism heading into the midterm elections. Speaking with hosts David Gura and Christina Ruffini, Pappas says Democrats must keep reaching independent and ticket-splitting voters while focusing on the economy, cost of living and President Donald Trump’s leadership. (Source: Bloomberg)</description>
